ous of the environment as it too can harm JAEJAX.<br><br>Find SECRET ITEMS, such as the RUIN RING! Gain NEW ABILITIES, such as BURNING BLOOD SLASH!<br><br>Defeat powerful DEITIES to add them to your harem of SUMMONS!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851190/extras/82242c461a2026106ac7adc02da40b49.poster.avif?t=1667625941\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851190/extras/82242c461a2026106ac7adc02da40b49.webm?t=1667625941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851190/extras/82242c461a2026106ac7adc02da40b49.mp4?t=1667625941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Summon and play as 6 UNIQUE DEITIES and 3 SECRET summons!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851190/extras/71e046aa7aac7420095acfbfd7d7af58.poster.avif?t=1667625941\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851190/extras/71e046aa7aac7420095acfbfd7d7af58.webm?t=1667625941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851190/extras/71e046aa7aac7420095acfbfd7d7af58.mp4?t=1667625941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851190/extras/f631ff3f1d662f9700ceb34e2dd499cf.poster.avif?t=1667625941\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851190/extras/f631ff3f1d662f9700ceb34e2dd499cf.webm?t=1667625941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851190/extras/f631