=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851190/extras/c8f0999e7394795b9633ec7827d0a048.poster.avif?t=1667625941\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851190/extras/c8f0999e7394795b9633ec7827d0a048.webm?t=1667625941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851190/extras/c8f0999e7394795b9633ec7827d0a048.mp4?t=1667625941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>UNLOCK HATS and ACCESSORIES, such as the exquisite TOP HAT and MONACLE, by completing in-game achievements!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851190/extras/6b0fb999e42da9eb7547ae33c35fffab.poster.avif?t=1667625941\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851190/extras/6b0fb999e42da9eb7547ae33c35fffab.webm?t=1667625941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851190/extras/6b0fb999e42da9eb7547ae33c35fffab.mp4?t=1667625941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Seductive HEART attacks can be performed from certain enemies. These attacks will cause JAEJAX to be put into a SEDUCTION STATE!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Graphic 18+ Sexualized Full Screen Pixel Art Cutscenes</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851190/extras/3fb497dc914155a22d502fa17df32770.avif?t=1667625941\" /></div><br><br>Defeating enemies yields a chance for a SPECIAL item to drop to unlock art in the art gallery.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851190/extras/a637e06e8a16279d6f7ee746111bf8d0.avif?t=1667625941\" /></div><br><br>Unlock Boss Rush <br><br>UNCOVER Secret power ups that require cursed garments to be worn!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DEITY SOULS Plus Is Rated 18+ (adult)</h2></h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851190/extras/6886abb410e81f292dd3d76662c34439.poster.avif?t=1667625941\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851190/extras/6886abb410e81f292dd3d76662c34439.webm?t=1667625941\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851190/extras/6886abb410e81f292dd3d76662c34439.mp4?t=1667625941\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
